## 2) Environment & Defaults (`.env`)

```bash
# CA subjects
ROOT_CN="Acme Offline Root CA"
ROOT_DAYS=7300                 # 20 years
INT_CN="Acme TLS Issuing CA"
INT_DAYS=1825                  # 5 years

# End-entity defaults
LEAF_DAYS=397                  # Browsers’ cap guidance
KEY_BITS=4096
KEY_TYPE="rsa"                 # or "ec"
EC_CURVE="prime256v1"

# CRL / OCSP
CRL_DAYS=7
OCSP_PORT=2560

# Paths
PKI_DIR="$(pwd)"
```

> Scripts should `set -euo pipefail`, `umask 077`, and source `.env`.

