## 8) Example: Issue a Server Cert

```bash
# 1) Generate CSR
./bin/gen-csr.sh --cn api.internal.example.com \
  --san DNS:api.internal.example.com,DNS:api,IP:10.20.30.40 \
  --key-type ec --ec-curve prime256v1

# 2) Issue (server profile)
./bin/ca-issue.sh --cn api.internal.example.com --profile server --days 365

# 3) Verify
./bin/ca-verify.sh --cn api.internal.example.com

# Outputs
# out/issued/api.internal.example.com/private.key.pem
# out/issued/api.internal.example.com/cert.pem
# out/issued/api.internal.example.com/fullchain.pem
```

