## 10) Minimal `util.sh` (shared helpers)

```bash
#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail

umask 077

log() { printf '[%s] %s\n' "$(date -Is)" "$*" | tee -a out/ops.log; }
die() { log "ERROR: $*"; exit 1; }

need() { command -v "$1" >/dev/null || die "missing dependency: $1"; }
need openssl
mkdir -p out/bundles out/issued

lock() {
  mkdir -p .locks
  exec {LOCKFD}<>".locks/$1.lock"
  flock -n "$LOCKFD" || die "another operation is in progress: $1"
}
```

> Each script should `source "$(dirname "$0")/util.sh"` and `lock ca-int` or `lock ca-root` accordingly.

